      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-06T23:26:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When I started writtin my response there was none, but I am too slow writing in English... Also I wanted to provide sources and such.&nbsp;</p><p>But: my understanding is that it is compulsory to play at least with 3 heores, not \"advisable\". The fact that it is not clearly stated in the Enhanced Edition Rulebook is an error of the rulebook.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(Of course, you can play only with two heroes if you really want, as an atypical SotM experience. You can also play against Citizen Dawn but substitute all the \"Devastating Aurora\" card with cheese slices. It´s your game, it's your house. :P)</p>",
