      "created_at": "2013-04-07T08:35:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think the enhanced edition was a big improvement over the first one. Better mechanics, art in the environment cards, better box which is a suitable storage solution, full art separators, life counters, effects markers...&nbsp;</p><p>The rulebook has some errors. But after the first games you don´t play with the rulebook.&nbsp;</p><p>(But I understand your frustation after 7 games... )</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
